# Prowse-TUI
Programmable, headless browsing from a keyboard driven terminal interface.

## Navigation
@key j / Down     move down
@key k / Up       move up
@key Space / b    page down / page up
@key g / G        jump to top / bottom
@key Enter / l    follow the selected link
@key Esc / h      close the current view

